    feat: keep each registry's outcome visible in the level 1 header (DEVDESK-305)

    The image search level 1 header now shows one line per registry whose
    outcome is not a plain success: Pending, Interrupted, Failed, Refused,
    Partial, No result and Skipped. Lines beyond the budget of 7 collapse
    into a "+N" line. The header value width is exported so the router and
    the view agree on it.

